pdf.min.js, pdf.worker.min.js and signature_pad.umd.min.js now ship
in this directory by default (pdf.js 3.11.174, signature_pad 5.0.4 —
see src/Vendor/Assets.php's PDFJS_VERSION/SIGPAD_VERSION constants,
which must stay in sync with whatever's actually sitting here).

Why vendored: GLPI installations can run on isolated networks where
CDN access is blocked, and loading arbitrary third-party JS from a
CDN inside an authenticated GLPI session on every Report tab view is
its own exposure (a compromised/hijacked CDN gets script execution
with the viewer's session cookie) — see Assets::urls()'s docblock.
Assets::urls() only falls back to cdnjs.cloudflare.com (with
Subresource Integrity pinning — see emitPreviewScript()) if one of
these three files is ever missing; delete a file here to intentionally
re-enable that fallback for it, or replace these with a newer version
(update PDFJS_VERSION/SIGPAD_VERSION to match).
